%% Billing run (apps/api/src/billing.ts). Two runs may overlap; one may crash halfway.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Billing run A
  participant B as Billing run B, same moment
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  A->>DB: INSERT billing_runs, as_of = app_now()
  B->>DB: INSERT billing_runs, as_of = app_now()
  A->>DB: candidates: resources used after their last charged hour
  B->>DB: the same candidates
  loop each resource in its own transaction
    A->>DB: INSERT a charge per due hour, ON CONFLICT (resource, hour_start) DO NOTHING
    B->>DB: the same INSERT for the same rows
    Note over DB: B waits on the unique index entry, then skips what A committed
    alt the item fails (bad record)
      A->>DB: INSERT billing_failures, continue with the next item
    end
  end
  Note over A: a crash here keeps the committed items, the next run inserts only what is missing
  A->>DB: UPDATE billing_runs with counts and finished_at
  Note over DB: after downtime the next run recomputes every hour from usage history, so missed hours are charged once
